      "height": 2736,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Dan Lundberg",
      "description": "Dinner starts with seafood cocktail with coleslaw Hawaii and cocktail sauce.  The soup is cream of mushroom with croutons.  For my main course I choose the Chicken Platter served with grilled vegetables, vegetable rice, and potato wedges accompanied by a barbecue and black pepper sauce.  Dessert is a fruit compote and a raspberry mousse cake.\nOn Google Earth:\n\nThe Rainforest Ecolodge  6°23'21.85\"N, 80°35'47.62\"",
